Package: libkysdk-notification
Architecture: any
Depends: libc6,
         libqt5core5a,
         libqt5dbus5,
         libstdc++6,
Description: Kylin system notification interface
 This package provides interfaces for invoking notification
 pop-ups for the system notification module, assisting the
 notification component in correctly displaying system messages.

Package: libkysdk-notification-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libkysdk-notification(= ${binary:Version}),
         ${shlibs:Depends},
		     ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for libkysdk-notification modal
 This package provides interfaces for invoking notification
 pop-ups for the system notification module, assisting the
 notification component in correctly displaying system messages.
 Contains development files for libkysdk-notification.

